WEBVTT

01:31.424 --> 01:34.560
[Episode 21]

01:34.560 --> 01:38.259
[Bofeng House]

01:41.719 --> 01:43.219
Madam.

01:44.280 --> 01:47.079
I wonder how Ms. Yan is doing.

01:47.079 --> 01:48.120
Madam.

01:48.120 --> 01:50.640
You usually compete fiercely
for business with Ms. Yan,

01:50.640 --> 01:52.420
but you still care about her quite a bit.

01:53.120 --> 01:54.239
These are two different things.

01:54.239 --> 01:57.000
Haven't you seen
how terrifying those Eternity Pill users are?

01:57.000 --> 01:58.920
The head of the Zhao family and his mother

01:58.920 --> 02:00.859
are both dead.

02:02.959 --> 02:06.799
It's not easy for a woman like Ms. Yan
to build her career out there.

02:06.799 --> 02:09.379
Thanks to Miss Meng, she was saved.

02:24.400 --> 02:27.719
Thank heavens, Miss Meng.

02:27.719 --> 02:29.879
The toxin in her body is gradually reducing.

02:29.879 --> 02:33.300
Just take good care of her health,
and she will be fine.

02:42.800 --> 02:44.500
Thankfully, you're fine.

02:45.759 --> 02:47.419
Thankfully, you came to your senses.

03:00.919 --> 03:02.759
Meng.

03:02.759 --> 03:04.259
Fu Zhi.

03:07.400 --> 03:10.099
Did I hurt you?

03:15.840 --> 03:17.780
It's my fault.

03:20.240 --> 03:22.780
I got you into trouble.

03:26.759 --> 03:28.259
I'm sorry.

03:40.680 --> 03:42.659
I'm sorry, Fu Zhi.

03:51.520 --> 03:53.020
Don't cry.

04:40.319 --> 04:42.459
Thank you for coming late at night,
Your Majesty.

04:47.120 --> 04:49.100
Fu Zhi is now out of danger.

05:03.639 --> 05:05.300
In that case,

05:06.639 --> 05:08.759
why are you still crying?

05:08.759 --> 05:10.259
I'm afraid.

05:12.560 --> 05:15.019
I'm afraid all this is just a dream.

05:15.680 --> 05:18.220
I'm afraid there will be
even more dangerous things ahead.

05:19.000 --> 05:23.579
I'm afraid that even if I give it my all,
I still fail to protect those I care about.

05:32.439 --> 05:34.120
Recently,

05:34.120 --> 05:37.100
seeing you and Miss Yan protect each other,

05:38.279 --> 05:40.019
I have finally come to realize

05:40.959 --> 05:44.519
that without the myriad lights of families
in these streets,

05:44.519 --> 05:46.112
this vast land would mean nothing

05:46.112 --> 05:49.379
but just a cold outline on a map.

05:50.319 --> 05:52.060
But I am afraid

05:54.279 --> 05:57.680
I can't even protect the light
right in front of me.

05:57.680 --> 06:00.300
The light you are sworn to protect

06:01.079 --> 06:03.839
is precisely what I must protect.

06:03.839 --> 06:07.500
You protect it, and I will protect you.

06:14.240 --> 06:16.420
And the common people.

06:30.040 --> 06:31.040
[Censorate]
Come out!

06:31.040 --> 06:34.040
Meng Ting Hui, get out here!

06:34.040 --> 06:35.279
Don't be a coward!

06:35.279 --> 06:37.939
- Get out here!
- Don't be a coward!

06:38.560 --> 06:40.180
Meng Ting Hui!

06:42.920 --> 06:44.420
Meng Ting Hui!

06:47.480 --> 06:49.100
- Don't move!
- Back off!

06:51.199 --> 06:53.199
Meng Ting Hui!

06:53.199 --> 06:54.759
Calm down!

06:54.759 --> 06:56.720
My father and grandmother
have not yet been laid to rest!

06:56.720 --> 06:59.199
How dare you hide here like a coward!

06:59.199 --> 07:00.879
The birthday feast has turned into a funeral!

07:00.879 --> 07:02.600
They would turn over in their graves!

07:02.600 --> 07:04.519
If I don't give them justice,

07:04.519 --> 07:06.459
how can I let them rest in peace?

07:10.000 --> 07:13.839
How could you let Ling Yun Fei escape?

07:13.839 --> 07:16.480
Today, it is my family that suffers.

07:16.480 --> 07:17.480
What about tomorrow?

07:17.480 --> 07:22.319
Must we all live in misery every day?

07:22.319 --> 07:25.519
- Exactly!
- My son!

07:25.519 --> 07:28.519
You said
you would save money to marry a wife.

07:28.519 --> 07:31.680
I can't believe you died before me.

07:31.680 --> 07:34.740
How am I supposed to go on living?

07:37.279 --> 07:39.839
You ruthless officials!

07:39.839 --> 07:42.040
You don't care about our lives at all!

07:42.040 --> 07:45.420
Hit them!

07:47.480 --> 07:49.000
Hit you all!

07:49.000 --> 07:50.920
Back off!

07:50.920 --> 07:52.620
How could you shamelessly block us?

08:01.399 --> 08:03.279
Yin Qing.

08:03.279 --> 08:04.779
I'm fine, Miss Meng.

08:06.560 --> 08:09.079
Listen, everyone!

08:09.079 --> 08:11.980
I deeply understand your pain and fear.

08:13.040 --> 08:16.839
I'll make a pledge today.

08:16.839 --> 08:18.560
I vow

08:18.560 --> 08:21.360
to eradicate the Eternity Pill
and capture Ling Yun Fei within ten days

08:21.360 --> 08:23.600
to restore peace to the people.

08:23.600 --> 08:25.600
Ten days? Can you really catch him?

08:25.600 --> 08:26.839
Is that for real?

08:26.839 --> 08:28.399
Miss Meng, please think twice!

08:28.399 --> 08:29.920
Ten days is too short!

08:29.920 --> 08:32.759
A pledge is no child's play. It's serious.

08:32.759 --> 08:36.399
I won't change my mind.
And I'm absolutely serious.

08:36.399 --> 08:39.320
Everyone present here can bear witness.

08:39.320 --> 08:40.879
Within ten days,

08:40.879 --> 08:45.240
if I fail, I'll willingly resign

08:45.240 --> 08:48.940
and get punished by law.

08:55.080 --> 08:57.759
Your Majesty,
the leader of Huxiao Gang has escaped.

08:57.759 --> 08:59.679
The whereabouts of the Eternity Pill
are unknown.

08:59.679 --> 09:03.120
If they make a comeback,
the capital will surely come to a crisis.

09:03.120 --> 09:04.799
Today, I impeach Meng Ting Hui

09:04.799 --> 09:06.559
because the people
are boiling with resentment.

09:06.559 --> 09:09.320
If we don't appease them,
I fear great chaos will erupt.

09:09.320 --> 09:11.080
I humbly request Your Majesty

09:11.080 --> 09:13.320
to dismiss and punish her

09:13.320 --> 09:15.179
to appease the people.

09:16.399 --> 09:17.440
Your Majesty.

09:17.440 --> 09:20.340
I've always had differing views from Lord Xu,

09:21.720 --> 09:24.679
but I second his appeal this time.

09:24.679 --> 09:26.399
Ling Yun Fei has wreaked havoc in the capital

09:26.399 --> 09:28.159
because of Meng Ting Hui.

09:28.159 --> 09:29.720
For now,

09:29.720 --> 09:31.240
dismissing her can appease the people

09:31.240 --> 09:34.419
and temporarily stop Ling Yun Fei
from doing evil again.

09:37.639 --> 09:38.759
Absurd!

09:38.759 --> 09:40.759
Huxiao Gang stirred up things,

09:40.759 --> 09:43.480
yet you asked me
to punish the Director of Censorate.

09:43.480 --> 09:45.720
I can't believe
a gang leader, with a poison pill,

09:45.720 --> 09:48.360
has thrown my court into complete chaos.

09:48.360 --> 09:50.840
If an enemy nation invades in the future,

09:50.840 --> 09:54.019
will you all be scrambling to surrender?

09:55.320 --> 09:56.559
Your Majesty.

09:56.559 --> 09:58.039
Your Majesty!

09:58.039 --> 10:01.379
I willingly accept punishment.

10:04.159 --> 10:07.360
The crime of the Eternity Pill case
lies with the Huxiao Gang.

10:07.360 --> 10:10.460
And the responsibility to solve the case lies
with the Censorate, and even more so with me.

10:11.240 --> 10:13.720
I have already made a pledge to the people.

10:13.720 --> 10:15.360
Within ten days,

10:15.360 --> 10:19.000
if I fail to eradicate the Eternity Pill
and capture Ling Yun Fei,

10:19.000 --> 10:21.220
I'm willing to accept any punishment.

10:28.600 --> 10:30.120
Meng Ting Hui,

10:30.120 --> 10:32.120
I see your eagerness
to bring the culprit to justice.

10:32.120 --> 10:33.879
So I'll give you ten days.

10:33.879 --> 10:38.440
Your Majesty, it's her duty to make a pledge.

10:38.440 --> 10:42.080
And today's situation
is the result of her negligence.

10:42.080 --> 10:45.039
According to the Laws of Ning Empire,
she shall be caned 20 times

10:45.039 --> 10:46.440
as a warning to others.

10:46.440 --> 10:47.940
Enough!

10:49.360 --> 10:53.039
Meng Ting Hui has already made a pledge.

10:53.039 --> 10:56.879
As court officials, instead of thinking
about how to suppress the gang together,

10:56.879 --> 10:59.720
you're here attacking your colleague
based on rumors.

10:59.720 --> 11:02.559
I think you're the ones
who deserve to be caned 20 times.

11:02.559 --> 11:04.080
Your Majesty.

11:04.080 --> 11:07.120
As I watched the people suffer,

11:07.120 --> 11:08.919
my heart ached.

11:08.919 --> 11:10.679
I accept the punishment

11:10.679 --> 11:12.279
to apologize to the people.

11:12.279 --> 11:13.779
Your Majesty.

11:16.919 --> 11:20.580
Your Majesty, we're willing
to be punished with Miss Meng.

11:22.799 --> 11:25.360
I am the Director of Censorate.

11:25.360 --> 11:26.799
My punishment is mine alone to bear.

11:26.799 --> 11:28.960
I'm the Assistant Director,
so I'm also responsible.

11:28.960 --> 11:30.879
I'm also from the Censorate, so I deserve it.

11:30.879 --> 11:33.080
I'm responsible for not solving the case yet.

11:33.080 --> 11:34.580
I'm also responsible for it.

12:32.992 --> 12:36.948
[Shen Mansion]

12:41.240 --> 12:42.860
It must hurt terribly.

12:43.600 --> 12:45.440
You've been weak since childhood.

12:45.440 --> 12:49.759
Even if it's just a flesh wound,
you still need to rest properly.

12:49.759 --> 12:53.080
I didn't act on impulse.

12:53.080 --> 12:54.580
I understand.

12:56.000 --> 13:00.159
Back in the day, I ranked seventeenth
in the first class of scholars.

13:00.159 --> 13:05.379
When I first entered the Hanlin Academy,
I was also full of passion.

13:06.639 --> 13:08.240
Since I married your father,

13:08.240 --> 13:11.940
I've become a housewife, yet without regrets.

13:12.559 --> 13:17.240
But seeing you stick with the Censorate,

13:17.240 --> 13:20.159
I feel as if I'm seeing my former self.

13:20.159 --> 13:24.059
And you're more courageous than me.

13:25.440 --> 13:28.740
I am truly proud of you.

13:29.799 --> 13:31.299
Mother.

13:32.320 --> 13:36.899
I've been down this road,
so I know how difficult it is.

13:38.000 --> 13:40.460
I only did what I should do.

13:41.879 --> 13:46.919
Indeed, the path ahead is hard,
but it shows how good Miss Meng is.

13:46.919 --> 13:49.840
As a woman leading the Censorate,

13:49.840 --> 13:52.000
she publicly made a pledge.

13:52.000 --> 13:54.919
She is a role model for all women.

13:54.919 --> 13:58.059
I must recover from my injuries quickly
and go help her.

13:59.399 --> 14:00.940
Li,

14:02.159 --> 14:03.980
you have truly grown up.

14:11.120 --> 14:14.700
I wonder how Zhi Shu and Nian are doing.

14:16.320 --> 14:19.399
Father, why can Zhi Li eat in her room?

14:19.399 --> 14:21.080
Why do I have to come to the dining hall?

14:21.080 --> 14:24.399
I only walked a few steps,
and my back is already starting to hurt.

14:24.399 --> 14:27.200
If it's too much for you,
just go back and rest.

14:27.200 --> 14:28.639
How can I do that?

14:28.639 --> 14:31.399
Pain aside, I still have to eat.

14:31.399 --> 14:33.639
Besides, you personally cooked this meal.

14:33.639 --> 14:35.539
It would be a shame not to eat it.

14:37.120 --> 14:38.620
Careful, Zhi Shu.

14:39.399 --> 14:40.919
The beating was on the back.

14:40.919 --> 14:43.279
Why does your backside hurt too?

14:43.279 --> 14:45.600
I was caned 20 times.

14:45.600 --> 14:47.559
It takes a long time to recover.

14:47.559 --> 14:50.659
I'm afraid my back is badly mangled.

14:52.039 --> 14:53.120
Nian, take a seat.

14:53.120 --> 14:54.440
Alright.

14:54.440 --> 14:58.399
I think you've spent too much time
in the entertainment places.

14:58.399 --> 15:00.120
Your martial skills are getting rusty.

15:00.120 --> 15:02.320
You need to practice properly.

15:02.320 --> 15:03.879
Look at Nian.

15:03.879 --> 15:05.399
He also took 20 strokes.

15:05.399 --> 15:07.559
Did you hear him complain about the pain?

15:07.559 --> 15:09.360
I'm used to injuries.

15:09.360 --> 15:10.440
In fact,

15:10.440 --> 15:13.159
Zhi Shu travels back and forth
between Changle Street and the Censorate,

15:13.159 --> 15:14.879
which actually takes a lot of mental energy.

15:14.879 --> 15:17.600
You set a good example
as a son of the Shen family.

15:17.600 --> 15:19.840
You lead the Divine Guards
at such a young age.

15:19.840 --> 15:21.200
You used to bravely charge into battle.

15:21.200 --> 15:23.279
And you're considerate at home.

15:23.279 --> 15:25.399
Well done. Come on, let's have a drink.

15:25.399 --> 15:26.940
Thank you, Father.

15:29.639 --> 15:35.039
Father, your good son is tough.

15:35.039 --> 15:37.419
I naturally can't compare to him.

15:38.320 --> 15:40.799
But I'm much stronger than Zhi Li.

15:40.799 --> 15:43.200
She's still bedridden.

15:43.200 --> 15:44.799
Oh, good for you.

15:44.799 --> 15:47.519
As an elder brother,
you're actually mocking your sister?

15:47.519 --> 15:49.259
Aren't you ashamed of yourself?

15:52.080 --> 15:54.940
I wonder how Zhi Li is.

15:55.840 --> 15:58.120
She is fine.
Your mother is looking after her.

15:58.120 --> 15:59.159
Eat up.

15:59.159 --> 16:01.200
Master.

16:01.200 --> 16:03.794
The tonic you requested is ready.

16:03.794 --> 16:07.240
Father, let me do it.
I'll deliver it to Zhi Li.

16:07.240 --> 16:08.799
Fine.

16:08.799 --> 16:10.299
Thank you, Father.

16:15.360 --> 16:18.539
Nian's constitution is really excellent.

16:19.840 --> 16:21.759
Father, look.

16:21.759 --> 16:24.360
I'm as insignificant as dust at this home.

16:24.360 --> 16:27.159
All this good food
still can't shut your mouth?

16:27.159 --> 16:28.659
Just eat.

16:43.360 --> 16:44.860
Thank you, Father.

16:51.080 --> 16:52.580
You brat.

16:53.759 --> 16:55.259
Drink.

17:17.039 --> 17:19.240
How did you get beaten like this?

17:19.240 --> 17:22.240
Fu Zhi, don't cry.

17:22.240 --> 17:26.720
I used to have more serious injuries.

17:26.720 --> 17:28.740
It'll be fine in a couple of days.

17:30.720 --> 17:33.160
No matter how badly you were injured before,

17:33.160 --> 17:35.099
you always smiled and said it was nothing.

17:36.519 --> 17:39.079
Those well-read men in the court

17:39.079 --> 17:41.079
not only failed
to help you fight Huxiao Gang,

17:41.079 --> 17:42.200
but also treated you like this.

17:42.200 --> 17:44.480
I'll go confront His Majesty.

17:44.480 --> 17:46.039
You're wholeheartedly devoted to the country.

17:46.039 --> 17:47.779
Why couldn't he protect you?

17:52.119 --> 17:54.059
Miss Yan, are you looking for me?

18:00.119 --> 18:03.119
Your Majesty, Meng only has me as her family.

18:03.119 --> 18:04.319
She's suffered a lot.

18:04.319 --> 18:07.960
She has been framed,
bullied, insulted, and threatened.

18:07.960 --> 18:10.279
Time and again, she nearly lost her life.

18:10.279 --> 18:12.599
Those who targeted her are heinous.

18:12.599 --> 18:15.720
But this time, it was Your Majesty
who personally ordered her punishment.

18:15.720 --> 18:18.160
- Fu Zhi.
- To give an explanation to your officials,

18:18.160 --> 18:20.920
Your Majesty used Meng as a pawn.

18:20.920 --> 18:23.240
But she is the treasure in my heart.

18:23.240 --> 18:26.240
If she fails to solve the case in ten days,

18:26.240 --> 18:29.559
I only beg Your Majesty
to spare her life and dismiss her.

18:29.559 --> 18:30.960
I will take her back to Shazhou.

18:30.960 --> 18:34.559
From then on,
I will never let anyone hurt her again.

18:34.559 --> 18:37.380
I'm done. Please punish me, Your Majesty.

18:39.000 --> 18:42.140
Miss Yan, I promise you.

18:42.799 --> 18:45.299
What you fear will definitely not happen.

18:47.759 --> 18:49.880
I believe
Your Majesty will keep your promise.

18:49.880 --> 18:52.140
And I will keep it in mind.

18:56.484 --> 18:58.740
I'll leave Your Majesty and Meng to talk.

19:11.119 --> 19:12.619
Your Majesty.

19:14.240 --> 19:19.200
Fu Zhi is worried about my safety.

19:19.200 --> 19:20.559
Please do not blame her.

19:20.559 --> 19:23.819
She was right. It was my fault.

19:26.480 --> 19:28.740
I failed to protect you.

19:29.784 --> 19:32.680
I brought the special medicine from Beijian.

19:32.680 --> 19:35.400
It can remove scars and relieve pain.

19:35.400 --> 19:36.900
Let me apply it for you.

19:42.799 --> 19:44.299
I

19:45.759 --> 19:47.519
dare not trouble Your Majesty.

19:47.519 --> 19:50.299
Won't you even let me help
with such a small matter?

19:56.200 --> 19:59.660
This medicine may feel hot
when first applied.

20:01.039 --> 20:02.619
I will be careful.

20:45.480 --> 20:49.559
This mark on your back is quite unique.

20:49.559 --> 20:51.059
A mark?

20:52.480 --> 20:54.880
Which one are you referring to?

20:54.880 --> 20:57.680
I was beaten a lot as a child

20:57.680 --> 21:00.079
and got many scars.

21:00.079 --> 21:01.579
I don't remember.

21:02.880 --> 21:06.160
Your Majesty,
the ten-day deadline is imminent.

21:06.160 --> 21:08.880
Perhaps only by finding the valley now

21:08.880 --> 21:11.519
can we stop the spread of the Eternity Pill.

21:11.519 --> 21:14.900
- I'll go to the outskirts with Yin Qing--
- You don't have to.

21:15.599 --> 21:18.440
I've already ordered Huang Bo
to search for the valley.

21:18.440 --> 21:20.039
Your top priority right now

21:20.039 --> 21:22.559
is to rest and recover your strength.

21:22.559 --> 21:24.240
Otherwise,

21:24.240 --> 21:26.819
I will truly take back your official robes.

21:29.000 --> 21:30.500
Yes, Your Majesty.

21:40.480 --> 21:42.680
The Black Bird is the guardian of Zhongwan.

21:42.680 --> 21:45.000
Royal children tattoo it on their shoulders
with a secret method at a young age,

21:45.000 --> 21:46.359
and it becomes more apparent with age.

21:46.359 --> 21:47.720
Did you see clearly, Your Majesty?

21:47.720 --> 21:50.720
Is the mark on Miss Meng's shoulder
the Black Bird totem?

21:50.720 --> 21:54.960
Although this mark appears alongside scars,
it's very conspicuous.

21:54.960 --> 21:56.400
I vaguely remember

21:56.400 --> 21:58.914
that the Zhongwan royal families killed
by my father back then

21:58.914 --> 22:00.839
also had such a mark on their bodies.

22:00.839 --> 22:03.039
But I was young at the time.

22:03.039 --> 22:06.319
Only you know the most about the past.

22:06.319 --> 22:10.359
Over a decade ago,
Zhongwan coveted our abundant resources.

22:10.359 --> 22:11.880
They provoked us several times.

22:11.880 --> 22:14.799
The late emperor hated their provocation
and personally led the campaign.

22:14.799 --> 22:17.119
Zhongwan resisted relentlessly

22:17.119 --> 22:19.839
but was ultimately subdued
by the late emperor with an iron fist.

22:19.839 --> 22:23.880
Their four-year-old princess also died
within the palace.

22:23.880 --> 22:28.980
Only a squad of warriors broke through
to protect a general's son.

22:30.119 --> 22:31.440
Based on age,

22:31.440 --> 22:33.440
Miss Meng and their princess are
of the same age.

22:33.440 --> 22:35.440
But didn't their princess already die?

22:35.440 --> 22:40.319
Now it seems
the dead princess might not be the real one.

22:40.319 --> 22:42.160
Perhaps the remnants of Zhongwan

22:42.160 --> 22:46.319
protected their royal bloodline
for the restoration of their country.

22:46.319 --> 22:47.920
Huiyin House
and the Blood Moon Society behind it

22:47.920 --> 22:49.680
have been plotting the restoration all along.

22:49.680 --> 22:52.400
Situ Xue is very close to Miss Meng.

22:52.400 --> 22:55.319
Perhaps Miss Meng is one of them,

22:55.319 --> 22:56.819
deliberately infiltrating the court.

22:58.480 --> 23:00.319
The ancestors have clearly stipulated

23:00.319 --> 23:01.680
that the surviving people of Zhongwan
shall be slaves

23:01.680 --> 23:03.160
and shall not be officials.

23:03.160 --> 23:05.604
The late emperor's intention was to guard

23:05.604 --> 23:08.079
against those who viciously disrupt the court
and harm the common people.

23:08.079 --> 23:11.359
So far, the remnants of Zhongwan
have been plotting to restore their country.

23:11.359 --> 23:15.864
Their royal bloodline
must be completely eradicated.

23:15.864 --> 23:18.700
Are you asking me to kill Miss Meng?

23:29.279 --> 23:32.359
I have already retired

23:32.359 --> 23:34.680
and should not be discussing state affairs.

23:34.680 --> 23:36.768
However,
Your Majesty is so close to Meng Ting Hui.

23:36.768 --> 23:38.960
There are already criticisms outside.

23:38.960 --> 23:40.720
It's truly worrisome.

23:40.720 --> 23:42.720
Your Majesty, I hope you'll be cautious

23:42.720 --> 23:45.400
and be wary of Meng Ting Hui

23:45.400 --> 23:49.440
and also the Blood Moon Society.

23:49.440 --> 23:52.079
Only in this way
can you be prepared for the unexpected

23:52.079 --> 23:54.140
and stabilize the nation.

23:55.626 --> 23:57.400
Father, don't worry.

23:57.400 --> 23:59.119
His Majesty has long ordered me
to keep an eye on Huiyin House

23:59.119 --> 24:00.920
and secretly watch the movements
of the Blood Moon Society.

24:00.920 --> 24:04.279
His Majesty will absolutely
put national interests above all.

24:04.279 --> 24:09.059
It's just that Miss Meng's identity
indeed needs to be re-examined.

24:12.799 --> 24:15.160
This matter concerns the feud
between the two nations.

24:15.160 --> 24:18.319
I will absolutely not take it lightly
or act on emotion.

24:18.319 --> 24:20.000
Regarding Meng Ting Hui and the Censorate,

24:20.000 --> 24:22.519
I will naturally remain wary.

24:22.519 --> 24:24.180
Wise decision, Your Majesty.

24:24.839 --> 24:26.440
Before the matter is concluded,

24:26.440 --> 24:28.200
we will certainly keep our mouths shut.

24:28.200 --> 24:30.859
Zhi Shu, remember this.

24:31.839 --> 24:35.180
Father, I'll naturally keep it a secret.

25:06.784 --> 25:08.359
[Censorate]

25:08.359 --> 25:11.319
We've searched their storehouses,
secret cellars,

25:11.319 --> 25:14.559
and even the caves in the mountain,

25:14.559 --> 25:16.480
but failed to find a single Eternity Pill.

25:16.480 --> 25:20.039
Moreover, the area for dozens of li
around Huxiao Gang is rocky.

25:20.039 --> 25:21.480
It cannot be the place
where the poison pill is made.

25:21.480 --> 25:24.240
Logically speaking,
Ling Yun Fei is severely injured.

25:24.240 --> 25:25.920
If he doesn't want to bleed to death,

25:25.920 --> 25:29.400
he won't hide
in a place far from the capital.

25:29.400 --> 25:32.440
Nian, you led men to search the valleys
on the outskirts of the capital.

25:32.440 --> 25:35.200
Did you truly not find any clues at all?

25:35.200 --> 25:37.200
There are 17 valleys
on the outskirts of the capital.

25:37.200 --> 25:39.359
Each one was compared against the painting.

25:39.359 --> 25:42.519
Huang Bo has led the Divine Guards
deep into the miasma forest,

25:42.519 --> 25:44.519
but no news yet.

25:44.519 --> 25:47.200
Huxiao Gang's lair has now been destroyed,

25:47.200 --> 25:49.039
but as long as Ling Yun Fei is still alive,

25:49.039 --> 25:53.220
given his extreme personality,
he will surely plot a more vicious revenge.

25:55.974 --> 25:58.880
Miss Meng, your injury?

25:58.880 --> 26:00.222
It's fine.

26:00.222 --> 26:02.319
Zhi Li, write a memorial to the throne now

26:02.319 --> 26:04.279
to request His Majesty
to send reinforcements.

26:04.279 --> 26:06.480
We must find the place
where the poison is made as soon as possible.

26:06.480 --> 26:10.099
Otherwise, disaster would loom.

27:45.079 --> 27:46.880
Tighten the iron chains!

27:46.880 --> 27:48.380
Yes.

27:52.599 --> 27:55.200
Master, according to your instructions,

27:55.200 --> 27:58.019
the dosage of the Fuqing herb
has been tripled.

27:59.920 --> 28:02.516
What fascinating fragrance!

28:05.822 --> 28:07.079
But it's not enough yet.

28:07.079 --> 28:08.319
Increase the dosage.

28:08.319 --> 28:11.720
Collect all the Fuqing herbs
in Wangxian Valley within ten days.

28:11.720 --> 28:14.759
This time, either Meng Ting Hui

28:14.759 --> 28:16.759
or I will die.

28:16.759 --> 28:19.099
Then you can prepare to die.

28:19.848 --> 28:23.000
Mr. Shangguan, you actually came.

28:23.000 --> 28:24.799
It seems you can't sit back anymore.

28:24.799 --> 28:29.480
You spread the Eternity Pill at Bofeng House
to get revenge on Meng Ting Hui.

28:29.480 --> 28:31.440
Now the whole city is under martial law.

28:31.440 --> 28:34.559
You are destroying our business.

28:34.559 --> 28:36.279
You always hide

28:36.279 --> 28:38.180
and earn small profits.

28:38.960 --> 28:42.160
Is this the vision of a coward like you?

28:42.160 --> 28:43.640
Listen up.

28:43.640 --> 28:45.920
If you trouble Meng Ting Hui again,

28:45.920 --> 28:48.400
I will have to kill you.

28:48.400 --> 28:51.759
What exactly is your relationship with her?

28:51.759 --> 28:53.799
You talk about her

28:53.799 --> 28:55.599
and protect her at every turn.

28:55.599 --> 29:00.740
Our business ends here.

29:11.200 --> 29:13.404
Do you think
I will just sit still and wait for death?

29:13.404 --> 29:17.328
Look,
this is the true power of the Eternity Pill.

29:17.328 --> 29:20.352
I will use an army of poison men
to massacre the capital.

29:20.352 --> 29:22.500
Meng Ting Hui is doomed.

29:31.072 --> 29:34.516
[Temporary Closure Notice]

29:40.599 --> 29:43.584
I originally wanted to earn money
to buy a big house

29:43.584 --> 29:46.140
and enjoy a good life with you.

29:47.319 --> 29:48.980
In the end, I lost everything.

29:51.640 --> 29:54.039
This time, thanks to you,

29:54.039 --> 29:55.700
I escaped from the jaws of death.

29:57.319 --> 29:59.119
It's thanks to Mr. Shen.

29:59.119 --> 30:00.672
To get the antidote for you,

30:00.672 --> 30:03.720
he even pawned the jade pendant bestowed
by the late emperor.

30:03.720 --> 30:07.920
But considering his eagerness to save you,
His Majesty did not blame him.

30:07.920 --> 30:09.799
But I heard from Zhi Li

30:09.799 --> 30:13.299
that Grand Tutor Shen punished him
by making him kneel for three days.

30:16.279 --> 30:18.140
He is sincere towards you.

30:21.972 --> 30:24.108
Having escaped death this time,

30:24.108 --> 30:26.519
I now realize
that a friend in need is a friend indeed.

30:26.519 --> 30:29.119
Since you have given your all to save me,

30:29.119 --> 30:30.779
I must live even better.

30:33.119 --> 30:34.956
Bofeng House will be closed for two months.

30:34.956 --> 30:36.924
And I will create more new dishes.

30:36.924 --> 30:38.280
When it reopens,

30:38.280 --> 30:40.900
I will definitely amaze all the diners here.

30:42.160 --> 30:43.839
But you haven't fully recovered yet,

30:43.839 --> 30:45.079
and Bofeng House is not safe.

30:45.079 --> 30:47.720
Stay at the Censorate for now,
and I can look after you.

30:47.720 --> 30:51.160
You've been busy looking for Ling Yun Fei.

30:51.160 --> 30:52.160
Do you have time for me?

30:52.160 --> 30:54.880
The deadline is approaching.

30:54.880 --> 30:56.640
But all leads on Ling Yun Fei have gone dead.

30:56.640 --> 31:00.528
The Light Cavalry has been searching valleys
for days, but no news yet.

31:00.528 --> 31:03.480
Even His Majesty has not come
to the Censorate for many days.

31:03.480 --> 31:05.539
It is quite strange.

31:06.684 --> 31:08.480
Alright, let's not think about it anymore.

31:08.480 --> 31:09.980
Let's go out for a walk.

31:18.039 --> 31:20.640
- Yin Qing.
- Miss Meng, Ms. Yan.

31:20.640 --> 31:22.104
You went to Huiyin House?

31:22.104 --> 31:23.680
Miss Situ often goes to the border

31:23.680 --> 31:25.359
and has some rare medicinal herbs

31:25.359 --> 31:26.880
as well as candles and incense.

31:26.880 --> 31:29.376
I need them to take care of Ms. Yan's health.

31:29.376 --> 31:30.956
Thank you.

31:31.559 --> 31:34.356
Captain Di has gone to check the valleys.
Has he found any clues?

31:34.356 --> 31:37.644
Why hasn't the Light Cavalry
sent a word to the Censorate so far?

31:37.644 --> 31:39.768
His Majesty personally
deployed the Divine Guards.

31:39.768 --> 31:43.220
All information is reported
directly to His Majesty.

31:44.519 --> 31:45.768
But I have good news.

31:45.768 --> 31:49.212
I happened to hear
that the Light Cavalry found a valley

31:49.212 --> 31:51.480
that somewhat resembles the one
in the painting.

31:51.480 --> 31:55.519
But your memorial to His Majesty
requesting more men

31:55.519 --> 31:57.339
has not been approved yet.

31:58.668 --> 32:01.908
The Divine Guards should
be assisting the Censorate in handling cases.

32:01.908 --> 32:04.000
Now they don't report to me.

32:04.000 --> 32:05.672
I need to borrow your candle.

32:06.348 --> 32:08.599
[Imperial Study]
Your Majesty, according to the Light Cavalry,

32:08.599 --> 32:11.920
Huang Bo went missing
at the last unsearched valley.

32:11.920 --> 32:13.279
It is called Wangxian Valley.

32:13.279 --> 32:14.440
The terrain there is dangerously steep.

32:14.440 --> 32:16.920
It is shrouded in mist all year round,
hindering visibility.

32:16.920 --> 32:19.799
The Light Cavalry found Huang Bo's dagger
at the entrance of the valley.

32:19.799 --> 32:22.319
Huang Bo never loses his personal belongings.

32:22.319 --> 32:23.760
Could he have encountered danger?

32:23.760 --> 32:25.404
You will immediately lead the Light Cavalry
to search the mountain.

32:25.404 --> 32:27.876
Does this matter need
to be reported to Miss Meng?

32:27.876 --> 32:31.092
We haven't found any Fuqing herb yet
in that valley.

32:31.092 --> 32:32.796
There is no need to tell her for now.

32:32.796 --> 32:34.799
- First, investigate thoroughly.
- I see.

32:34.799 --> 32:37.848
Your Majesty, I'm guilty!

32:37.848 --> 32:39.612
Not again.

32:39.612 --> 32:41.319
As Huang Bo is away,

32:41.319 --> 32:44.200
he has been nagging nonstop.

32:44.200 --> 32:46.900
Help me stop him before you go.

32:47.544 --> 32:49.064
Yes.

32:54.228 --> 32:56.920
His Majesty personally went
to the Huxiao Gang.

32:56.920 --> 32:59.519
I'm worried about His Majesty's safety.

32:59.519 --> 33:03.440
I couldn't get any peace of mind.

33:03.440 --> 33:06.360
I've failed the late emperor!

33:06.360 --> 33:08.680
Captain Di, lend me your sword.

33:08.680 --> 33:11.700
I'm going down
to join the late emperor right now.

33:22.164 --> 33:25.944
Captain Di, I am just so worried sick.

33:25.944 --> 33:29.000
His Majesty stays up late
reviewing memorials.

33:29.000 --> 33:32.100
It seems he caught a chill.

33:32.100 --> 33:34.848
I have prepared medicine.

33:34.848 --> 33:36.156
Your Majesty.

33:36.156 --> 33:38.940
[Nine Nine Nine]
Take good care of your health!

33:38.940 --> 33:40.448
- Your--
- You may leave.

33:42.880 --> 33:46.440
Your Majesty, take good care of your health!

33:46.440 --> 33:49.140
Your Majesty!

34:00.200 --> 34:02.220
Can you stop bothering me?

34:06.160 --> 34:08.199
So Your Majesty finds me bothersome.

34:08.199 --> 34:10.119
That's why you haven't come
to the Censorate recently.

34:10.119 --> 34:12.280
I thought Chief Steward You came.

34:12.280 --> 34:14.519
This is something from Huiyin House.

34:14.519 --> 34:16.239
Miss Situ specially made them.

34:16.239 --> 34:18.280
They can calm the mind.

34:18.280 --> 34:21.760
Your Majesty has been mentally bothered
with the Eternity Pill matter.

34:21.760 --> 34:22.908
You can give it a try.

34:22.908 --> 34:25.128
You didn't especially come

34:25.128 --> 34:26.808
just for this gift, right?

34:26.808 --> 34:28.212
The memorial I submitted

34:28.212 --> 34:32.500
requesting additional personnel
hasn't been approved yet.

34:37.572 --> 34:41.179
Do you know this image?

34:48.800 --> 34:50.052
No, I don't.

34:50.052 --> 34:52.840
This is the Black Bird revered by Zhongwan.

34:52.840 --> 34:56.244
It is said to be able to tell fortunes
and protect the nation.

34:56.244 --> 34:58.360
Later, Zhongwan submitted to the Ning Empire.

34:58.360 --> 35:02.820
Do you think I need to change the policies
towards their surviving people?

35:02.820 --> 35:04.480
Your Majesty.

35:04.480 --> 35:07.539
I have only read about Zhongwan in books.

35:08.199 --> 35:09.860
I don't know the actual situation.

35:13.692 --> 35:15.852
Miss Yan has just barely escaped danger.

35:15.852 --> 35:17.840
I also don't want you to face danger again.

35:17.840 --> 35:20.328
I have decided to make other plans.

35:20.328 --> 35:22.000
The Censorate will stay out of this case.

35:22.000 --> 35:25.000
Your Majesty, I can keep it professional.

35:25.000 --> 35:27.516
I was worried sick about Fu Zhi.

35:27.516 --> 35:30.732
Personally, I want to avenge her,
but so what?

35:30.732 --> 35:33.996
The Censorate has been pursuing Ling Yun Fei.

35:33.996 --> 35:35.880
And I am the right person for this case.

35:35.880 --> 35:37.360
I hope Your Majesty will change your mind.

35:37.360 --> 35:39.440
Ling Yun Fei is relentlessly targeting you.

35:39.440 --> 35:41.079
I worry about your safety.

35:41.079 --> 35:42.948
Just have a couple of days off.

35:42.948 --> 35:45.059
I made this decision out of concern for you.

35:46.239 --> 35:49.360
I feel you've been acting strangely.

35:49.360 --> 35:50.880
Are you hiding something from me?

35:50.880 --> 35:52.500
You don't need to overthink it.

35:52.500 --> 35:54.340
Just do what I said.

35:59.844 --> 36:02.199
Your Majesty, among all the court officials,

36:02.199 --> 36:04.212
who knows Ling Yun Fei better
than the Censorate?

36:04.212 --> 36:07.820
If you're worried about me,
you can send someone to follow me.

36:08.424 --> 36:10.960
But if you pull the Censorate
out of this case,

36:10.960 --> 36:12.579
I will go myself.

36:13.452 --> 36:15.599
Your Majesty, since you don't trust me,

36:15.599 --> 36:17.820
I don't need to wait for your approval.

36:19.159 --> 36:21.320
I already know where Wangxian Valley is.

36:21.320 --> 36:23.500
Since the day we met,

36:24.216 --> 36:26.579
I have known what kind of person you are.

36:32.712 --> 36:36.619
Trusting you means
allowing you to go into danger.

36:37.548 --> 36:39.559
I want my country to be stable,

36:39.559 --> 36:43.440
but I also want you to return safe and sound.

36:43.440 --> 36:47.420
The terrain of Wangxian Valley is complex.
I'll go there with you.

37:25.840 --> 37:27.340
You're awake.

37:28.079 --> 37:29.679
Wonderful.

37:29.679 --> 37:31.820
I was worried you would keep sleeping.

37:33.840 --> 37:35.340
Don't move.

37:40.320 --> 37:42.119
I'm just listening to your heartbeat,

37:42.119 --> 37:44.300
checking how your recovery is going.

37:51.840 --> 37:55.239
After drinking my medicine,
the snake venom inside has been removed.

37:55.239 --> 37:59.352
But it will take a few more days
to heal your leg injury.

37:59.352 --> 38:02.980
For now, you can't be up and about.

38:32.232 --> 38:33.972
Thank you for saving my life.

38:33.972 --> 38:36.108
You're welcome. My name is Luo.

38:36.108 --> 38:38.559
I'm a resident of Wangxian Valley.

38:38.559 --> 38:41.860
What's your name?

38:42.559 --> 38:44.440
My name is Huang Bo.

38:44.440 --> 38:46.059
Huang Bo.

38:58.079 --> 39:00.708
Luo, let me help you.

39:00.708 --> 39:03.340
Your leg injury hasn't healed yet.
Don't move around.

39:06.079 --> 39:07.400
Huang!

39:07.400 --> 39:08.900
Huang!

39:09.639 --> 39:10.639
Master!

39:10.639 --> 39:12.139
Be careful.

39:12.960 --> 39:14.460
Why are you all here?

39:19.740 --> 39:20.772
Luo,

39:20.772 --> 39:23.340
the lot of us came uninvited.

39:23.340 --> 39:24.384
Sorry to trouble you.

39:24.384 --> 39:25.716
No trouble at all.

39:25.716 --> 39:27.804
Usually, strangers rarely come here.

39:27.804 --> 39:29.800
I'm happy to host many guests.

39:29.800 --> 39:33.396
Besides, all of you are pretty

39:33.396 --> 39:35.420
and dressed much better than we are.

39:43.680 --> 39:44.988
Luo,

39:44.988 --> 39:49.068
did you see the same scenery in the valley?

39:49.068 --> 39:52.788
The scenery here is beautiful,
surrounded by clouds and mist.

39:52.788 --> 39:55.752
Looking up from the bottom of the valley,
it's like a fairyland.

39:55.752 --> 40:02.280
The scenery in this painting
does look similar.

40:02.280 --> 40:04.719
Luo, do you know a flower--

40:04.719 --> 40:06.400
Luo,

40:06.400 --> 40:08.880
I see many flowers in this courtyard.

40:08.880 --> 40:10.119
May I ask what they are used for?

40:10.119 --> 40:12.400
Tomorrow is the Flower Festival here.

40:12.400 --> 40:15.108
I'm busy preparing flower cakes
for the festival.

40:15.108 --> 40:17.480
I'll leave you all to rest and talk.

40:17.480 --> 40:19.980
If you need anything, just let me know.

40:27.280 --> 40:30.792
Miss Meng,
I was about to ask about the Fuqing herb.

40:30.792 --> 40:32.324
Why did you...
